  "title": "Polaris and Minnesota 4-H Expand Youth ATV Safety Education Through a Fun Interactive Adventure",
  "summary": "Minneapolis, MN [July 09, 2026] – Polaris in partnership with Minnesota 4-H, is expanding its youth ATV safety education with the launch of a new interactive safety adventure available on CLOVER, 4-H’s online learning platform. At its core, Trailblazers are built around a simple idea: learning safety should be as engaging and rewarding as the adventures young riders dream about having.",
